Case Scenario: Student Enrollment System
A college wants to automate its student enrollment process. Students must first log in to the system, view available subjects, and enroll in their chosen courses. The registrar validates the enrollment and confirms the student’s schedule. The system stores student records, course offerings, and schedules.

🏗️ System Actors:
Student – logs in, views subjects, and enrolls.

Registrar – verifies and confirms enrollment.

System – processes and stores enrollment data.
